cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Formalizing α-equivalence equations"
abstract: >-
  A formalization in the Rocq Prover of the equivalence between four
  definitions of α-equivalence for terms with named variables, covering
  nameless representations and explicit-name approaches based on
  substitution/renaming or swapping. This is the artifact of the paper with
  the same title.
authors:
